; ..\BSW364\ComM\Implementation\ComM.c	 10229  \DESCRIPTION       Call to ComM_CheckSyncCounterAndForwardFunction with pointers to local stack variables (synchronization counters) to be checked.
; ..\BSW364\ComM\Implementation\ComM.c	 10230                     The values of the synchronization counters are compared and - if needed - incremented afterwards.
; ..\BSW364\ComM\Implementation\ComM.c	 10231  \COUNTERMEASURE \N [CM_COMM_GENERAL_FUNCTIONCALL]
